le. Insurance companies often try to minimize payouts\u2014our experienced legal team fights to secure the compensation you deserve.<\/p>\n<h3>Get a Free Consultation with a Work Injury Lawyer<\/h3>\n<p>Time limits apply when filing your claim. Contact our <a href=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/contact\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bay Area work injury lawyers<\/a> today for a free consultation. We help injured workers obtain medical treatment, wage replacement, and full compensation.<\/p>\n<h2>What Benefits Can a Work Injury Lawyer Help You Obtain?<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Change your authorized treating doctor<\/li>\n<li>Indemnity and impairment benefits<\/li>\n<li>Reimbursement for medical travel expenses<\/li>\n<li>Maximum settlement of your workers\u2019 compensation claim<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3>Don\u2019t Let Insurance Companies Undervalue Your Claim<\/h3>\n<p>Insurance companies prioritize their profits, not your recovery. A skilled <strong>work injury lawyer<\/strong> holds them accountable and fights for your rights.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Call <a href=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/contact\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">(510) 257-4141<\/a> for a free consultation today!<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-w69d6333f75717-1\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\" ><div class=\"contact_locations panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-w69d6333f75717-1\" ><div id=\"pgc-w69d6333f75717-1-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w69d6333f75717-1-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"1\" ><div class=\"textwidget\"><h3><strong>Oakland<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>1720 Broadway<br \/>\nSuite 410<br \/>\nOakland, CA 94612<br \/>\nPhone: (510) 257-4141<br \/>\nFax: (510) 257-4110<\/p>\n<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"\/oakland-workers-compensation\/\">View Location<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-w69d6333f75717-1-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-ce